'''Tiberus Anderlock'''<ref name="Trivia">{{SW|url=obi-wan-kenobi-part-iii-trivia-gallery|text=Part III Trivia Gallery &#124; Obi-Wan Kenobi}}</ref> was an individual whose first name was carved on the wall of the facility used by the [[Hidden Path]] on the [[planet]] [[Jabiim]]. The Path was a network that smuggled [[Force-sensitive]]s and [[Jedi]] away from the [[Galactic Empire]]<ref name="Part V">{{Kenobi|Part V}}</ref> in [[9 BBY]].<ref name="Timeline">{{KenobiDate|V}}</ref>

